---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Resources | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Helpful resources for Arkansas homeowners looking to sell fast or avoid foreclosure, including foreclosure prevention guides and free downloads."
>

<!-- HEADER -->
<Header />

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="bg-navy pt-16 pb-14 sm:pt-22 sm:pb-18">
  <div class="max-w-3xl sm:max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Helpful Resources</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase leading-tight text-3xl sm:text-6xl mb-6">Resources To Help You Sell Your House Fast</h1>
    <p class="tagline-script mb-7">A resource, not just a buyer.</p>
    <p class="font-body text-white/70 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">We've compiled some resources on this page to help you sell your house fast or save you from foreclosure. We work with homeowners every day who need to sell their house but can't do it the traditional route through a real estate agent&hellip; and people going through foreclosure. So, use us as a resource too. We'd be glad to answer your questions, help you better understand your options, and walk you through how our "home buying" service works&hellip; where we'll make you a fair no-obligation, no-hassle offer. It's simple, straightforward, and just may be perfect for you.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESOURCES -->
<section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest text-center mb-3">Check These Out</p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-center mb-10">Resources &amp; Links</h2>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Free Guide: The Pros And Cons Of Selling A House To A Professional House Buyer</h3>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">This guide walks through your 3 options when you need to sell your house: working with an agent, selling it yourself, or selling to a real estate investor. It covers the pros, cons, costs, and timeline associated with each option&hellip; and shows you which option makes sense for your situation.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gray-200 text-grey font-sub font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-12">

    <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest text-center mb-3">Facing Foreclosure?</p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-2xl sm:text-3xl leading-tight text-center mb-10">Foreclosure Resources &amp; Information</h2>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
      <a href="https://www.fdic.gov/consumers/loans/prevention/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="lift bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-orange transition-colors block">
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">FDIC Foreclosure Prevention Information &rarr;</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">The FDIC is a government entity that created a great resource and "Foreclosure Prevention Toolkit." If you're in foreclosure, check it out.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="https://www.urbanpartners.us/post/2019/02/19/foreclosure-prevention-resource-guide-urban-affairs-coalition" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="lift bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-orange transition-colors block">
        <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Foreclosure Prevention Guide &rarr;</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">The Urban Affairs Coalition has a great foreclosure prevention guide to walk you through the foreclosure process.</p>
      </a>

      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-sub font-bold text-navy text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">5 Ways To Stop Or Avoid Foreclosure In Today's Market</h3>
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 bg-gray-200 text-grey font-sub font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="font-body text-grey text-base leading-relaxed mt-10">Need more information on the foreclosure process and how to stop foreclosure? Feel free to <a href="/contact-us/" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">contact us</a> anytime if you have questions, want a no-hassle situation evaluation, or want to just learn more about how we can help homeowners avoid foreclosure or sell unwanted properties for cash.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="bg-navy py-16 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="tagline-script mb-2">We're here to help &ndash; not to pressure you.</p>
    <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight mb-4">Have Questions? Let's Talk.</h2>
    <p class="font-body text-white/60 text-base mb-8 max-w-md mx-auto">No pressure and no obligation &ndash; just an honest conversation with a local Arkansas team that genuinely wants to help.</p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
      <a href="/contact-us/" class="bg-orange hover:bg-gold text-white font-sub font-bold text-xs px-8 py-3.5 rounded transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider">Contact Us</a>
      <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="font-sub font-bold text-sm text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        Or call (501) 504-7109
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />

</Layout>
